{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19719","headline":"河南府试赎帖赋得乡饮酒诗 · 吕温","name":"河南府试赎帖赋得乡饮酒诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酌言修旧典，刈楚始登堂。\n百拜宾仪尽，三终乐奏长。\n想同莺出谷，看似雁成行。\n礼罢知何适，随云入帝乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}